[00:00.000]作曲 : Monika Santucci/Maarten Vorwerk/Massimo Pezzetta | [by:LUXURI2001]
[00:27.526]Let my heart echo | 让我的心共振和鸣
[00:32.816]The way I feel when I’m with you | 正如你在身边时的感觉
[00:38.232]With every passing day I know | 我深知，过去的每一天
[00:43.433]That we’ll be here to stay | 我们将在此地永存
[00:46.952]So don’t give in to the fear | 所以别向恐惧屈膝
[00:49.529]And lose your grip just yet | 别此刻失去了掌控
[00:51.614]You’re my lifeline | 你就是我的生命线
[00:53.053]Hanging on this thread | 孤悬在这绳索之间
[00:54.988]Until we’re dead and gone | 直到我们消逝远去
[00:56.891]Don’t want to lose you | 我一刻不想失去你
[00:59.567]When everything around us turns in to ashes | 当你我周遭一切皆化为灰烬
[01:04.876]When I’m more lost than found yeah | 当我彷徨若失不曾找到归属
